translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_40ffc35e:

    # katherine "Surprisingly he was very supportive... He said that he'll let me marry him, making the child legitimate."
    katherine "出乎意料的是，他非常支持我……他说会让我嫁给他，让孩子名正言顺。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:250
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_03a772e0:

    # katherine "So that's what we did. We got married, and for the next 7 months, life was amazing."
    katherine "于是我们就这么做了。我们结了婚，接下来的七个月里，生活无比美好。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:254
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_773b7eae:

    # katherine "But then I overheard him talking to my mother one night."
    katherine "但有一天晚上，我无意中听到他和我母亲的谈话。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:255
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_91f2f8e5:

    # katherine "He said that they'll sell the child and kill the father, dissolving the marriage."
    katherine "他说他们会卖掉孩子，杀掉孩子的父亲，然后解除这段婚姻。"

