    # katherine "I couldn't bear the thought of that, so I decided that the second it's born, I'll send them both away."
    katherine "我无法忍受这个念头，所以我决定，孩子一出生，就把他们两个都送走。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:257
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_ff0bed89:

    # katherine "I was so overjoyed when I ended up having twin girls... But I had to abandon them, better to be seen as a monster than to have them suffer."
    katherine "当我最终生下一对双胞胎女儿时，我欣喜若狂……但我不得不抛弃她们。与其让她们受苦，我宁愿被当作一个恶魔。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:258
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_7c386f55:

