    # katherine "I tried once, but he hated me for doing what I did... He never knew the whole story..."
    katherine "我试过一次，但他恨我当初的所作所为……他从来不知道全部的真相……"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:269
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_254f876f:

    # katherine "But I know that if I explained everything, he would get himself in trouble with my father."
    katherine "但我知道，如果我把一切都解释清楚，他会为了我去找我父亲拼命。"

