    katherine "在那之后，我再也不敢联系了。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:274
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_20918e5d:

    # katherine "But then I got word, that he got sick and passed away... And I wanted to be there for the girls..."
    katherine "但后来我听说他生病去世了……我想去陪在孩子们身边……"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:275
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_0ff3d312:

    # katherine "But who am I? I'm just a stranger they've never seen, that's been rightfully villainized by their father."
    katherine "但我算什么？对她们来说，我只是个素未谋面的陌生人，还被她们的父亲正当合理地塑造成了一个坏女人。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:276
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_5cb0e731:

    # katherine "They wouldn't want to see me..."
    katherine "她们不会愿意见我的……"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:277
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_3a5bf3c5:

    # player "I think I understand... But that still doesn't explain why you're here, and the deal with the bar."
    player "我想我明白了……但这还是无法解释你为什么会在这里，还有关于那间酒吧的事。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:278
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_519208ef:

    # katherine "After the incident, word got out about the bar owners, my father found out and wanted \"What belonged to him\"."
    katherine "那件事之后，酒吧主人的风声传了出去，我父亲查到了，想要拿回‘属于他的东西’。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:279
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_a8e57197:

    # katherine "I had no choice. Because I'm their mother, if something happened to the girls, the bar would automatically go to me."
    katherine "我别无选择。因为我是她们的母亲，如果她们出了什么事，那间酒吧就会自动转到我名下。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:280
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_6c8d17b8:

    # katherine "So I had to do it my way, and keep my father away from them."
    katherine "所以我只能用我的方式行事，让我父亲远离她们。"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:281
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_99b90d30:

    # player "I see now... So you wanted to take the bar in a way that keeps the girls safe..."
    player "我现在明白了……所以你是想用一种能确保孩子们安全的方式，把酒吧夺过来……"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:285
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_72db2b33:

    # katherine "But I'm done with that now. I don't want to play this character anymore. I can't."
    katherine "但我现在不想这么做了。我不想再演这个角色了。我办不到。"

