# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:296
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_113b12bb:

    # katherine "That's because I'm not. I don't know what I was thinking..."
    katherine "因为我确实不是。我也不知道我当时在想什么……"

# game/scripts/Locations/katherine_house.rpy:300
translate chinese_simp katherine_confrontation_0368b758:

    # katherine "But I'm glad I did... I forgot how great it actually feels..."
    katherine "但我很高兴我那么做了……我都忘了那种感觉有多美妙了……"

